{
  "id": "E287",
  "title": "Two Meanings of “Fangbian”",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-01-02",
  "synopsis": "Some words may have multiple meanings. Pay attention to the context when people say “fangbian”.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/942/36ce6405edebe1d98d9f376b7d46f74289f0afd5.mp3?1546097842",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你什么时候方便？\n\n小乐：你们先吃饭，我去方便一下。\n安妮：方便一下？这是什么意思？\n丽丽：意思就是去一下卫生间。说“去方便一下”比较礼貌。\n安妮：原来是这样呀，我记住了!\n丽丽：对了安妮，上次你借给我的书我看完了。你什么时候方便？我给你送过去。\n安妮：我在卫生间的时候你来给我送书？这也太奇怪了。\n丽丽：我是说，你什么时候有空，我去找你。",
    "traditional": "你什麼時候方便？\n\n小樂：你們先吃飯，我去方便一下。\n安妮：方便一下？這是什麼意思？\n麗麗：意思就是去一下衛生間。說“去方便一下”比較禮貌。\n安妮：原來是這樣呀，我記住了!\n麗麗：對了安妮，上次你借給我的書我看完了。你什麼時候方便？我給你送過去。\n安妮：我在衛生間的時候你來給我送書？這也太奇怪了。\n麗麗：我是說，你什麼時候有空，我去找你。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When will you go to the toilet?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：你们先吃饭，我去方便一下。",
      "traditional": "小樂：你們先吃飯，我去方便一下。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ men xiān chī fàn wǒ qù fāng biàn yí xià",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: You guys go ahead and eat. I need to go to the washroom."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "安妮：方便一下？这是什么意思？",
      "traditional": "安妮：方便一下？這是什麼意思？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī fāng biàn yí xià zhè shì shén me yì si",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Go “fangbian”? What does that mean?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：意思就是去一下卫生间。说“去方便一下”比较礼貌。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：意思就是去一下衛生間。說“去方便一下”比較禮貌。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì yì si jiù shì qù yí xià wèi shēng jiān shuō qù fāng biàn yí xià bǐ jiào lǐ mào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: It means to go to the toilet. It is more polite to say “go to the washroom”."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "安妮：原来是这样呀，我记住了!",
      "traditional": "安妮：原來是這樣呀，我記住了!",
      "pinyin": "ān nī yuán lái shì zhè yàng ya wǒ jì zhù le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Oh, I see! I will remember this."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：对了安妮，上次你借给我的书我看完了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：對了安妮，上次你借給我的書我看完了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì duì le ān nī shàng cì nǐ jiè gěi wǒ de shū wǒ kàn wán le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "你什么时候方便？我给你送过去。",
      "traditional": "你什麼時候方便？我給你送過去。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ shén me shí hou fāng biàn wǒ gěi nǐ sòng guò qu",
      "english": "Lili: Oh, right, Annie. I finished the book you lent me last time."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When is convenient for you? I will come by and give it to you."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "安妮：我在卫生间的时候你来给我送书？这也太奇怪了。",
      "traditional": "安妮：我在衛生間的時候你來給我送書？這也太奇怪了。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wǒ zài wèi shēng jiān de shí hou nǐ lái gěi wǒ sòng shū zhè yě tài qí guài le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: You want to give back my book when I’m using the washroom? That's too weird."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我是说，你什么时候有空，我去找你。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我是說，你什麼時候有空，我去找你。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ shì shuō nǐ shén me shí hou yǒu kòng wǒ qù zhǎo nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I meant I will come by when you are available."
    }
