    "sentence_translations": [
      "When will you go to the toilet?",
      "",
      "Little Le: You guys go ahead and eat. I need to go to the washroom.",
      "",
      "Annie: Go “fangbian”? What does that mean?",
      "",
      "Lili: It means to go to the toilet. It is more polite to say “go to the washroom”.",
      "",
      "Annie: Oh, I see! I will remember this.",
      "",
      "Lili: Oh, right, Annie. I finished the book you lent me last time.",
      "When is convenient for you? I will come by and give it to you.",
      "",
      "Annie: You want to give back my book when I’m using the washroom? That's too weird.",
      "",
      "Lili: I meant I will come by when you are available.",
      ""
